Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — source-developed working scene
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-10-10
Status: Independent screenplay development under DEC-0019; refinements during production

INT. SELF-STORAGE MEETING ROOM - SATURDAY - DAY

Boxes pass the glass wall. Elias closes the blind; the archive laptop remains offline.

ELIAS
Sometimes being seen is safer than disappearing.

Zoe filters external events. Most are ordinary updates. Her own query audit gives Q-882104, LEGACY PLACEMENT VERIFICATION, CE/41/771, target P06-11803. Monday 09:14. Supporting basis: SEIZED MATERIAL REVIEW.

ZOE
They asked about the placement. Not directly about me.

A silent integrity-watch alert follows at 09:17. Restricted review, escalated risk, protective recovery authority approved. At 10:21: RECOVER — OPEN.

ZOE
Sixty-seven minutes. I didn't do something to cause Monday. Someone asked a question.

ELIAS
The timing strongly links it. We don't know the intended end state.

At 11:03 the ordinary answer says RECORD UNAVAILABLE — ARCHIVE MIGRATION. A follow-up asks for document authority. It is held, deferred and barred from release. No final answer appears in the snapshot.

ZOE
Someone was still looking then. Not necessarily now.

At Voss's separate desk, an old lawful adult job suggests CE can mean Central Evidence Liaison. He marks it as a possible reference family, not an identification of Zoe's questioner.

Back on Zoe's screen: sponsor AC019 voice advisory, acknowledged 16:48. She remembers Helen's later call.

ZOE
Maybe connected. No transcript. No proof she knew about the van.

She writes the limit beside it. Surveillance active 18:06. Recovery window Tuesday 15:00–18:00.

Her breath catches. She closes the table.

ZOE
The question made them move.

EXT. RESERVOIR - LATER

A dog refuses to give back its ball. Zoe writes ASK / WATCH / DON'T GUESS.

ZOE
One fact. No child name, medical detail or location. But know who the question could hurt.

ELIAS
And a source we can test. Not the whole drive sent to somebody we can't identify.

INT. UNDERGROUND CAR PARK - SAME AFTERNOON

Mac hears from his solicitor: the official follow-up still exists. The archive isn't contained. He selects a contact he normally would not call, pauses, then presses dial.
